  "question": {
    "text": "An object moves with speed $v_1, v_2$ and $v_3$ along a line segment $A B, B C$ and $C D$ respectively as shown in figure. Where $A B=B C$ and $A D=3 A B$, then average speed of the object will be:<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/_0HaGMo78di3prbwk2wmHmioxKdmfhVWHtLgzdIcEj0.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "hJb5L",
      "text": "$\\frac{v_1 v_2 v_3}{3\\left(v_1 v_2+v_2 v_3+v_3 v_1\\right)}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "F7QMr",
      "text": "$\\frac{3 v_1 v_2 v_3}{\\left(v_1 v_2+v_2 v_3+v_3 v_1\\right)}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "P6iIv",
      "text": "$\\frac{\\left(u_1+z_2+v_3\\right)}{3}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GKvk0",
      "text": "$\\frac{\\left(v_1+v_2+v_3\\right)}{3 v_1 v_2 v_3}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Consider,<br />$\\mathrm{AB}=x$<br />$\\mathrm{BC}=x$<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/EbqEENaTNsqrjlTiWsxn2gJmzuooLaDquP4T5PeIBPI.original.fullsize.png\"><br><br />$2 x+\\mathrm{CD}=3 x \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{CD}=3 x-2 x=x$<br />Average speed of the object $ < \\mathrm{v}>$<br />$=\\frac{\\text { Total distance }}{\\text { Total time }}$<br />$ < \\mathrm{v}>=\\frac{3 x}{\\frac{x}{v_1}+\\frac{x}{v_2}+\\frac{x}{v_3}}=\\frac{3 v_1 v_2 v_3}{v_2 v_3+v_1 v_3+v_1 v_2}$",
    "image": null
  },
